\par \sect\sectd\sectunlocked1\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1134\margrsxn1134\margtsxn1134\margbsxn1134\ltrsect\sbknone\pard\plain \s17\sl288\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
SharePoint contains a massive amount of functionality. The terms and acronyms can be daunting. Use this reference to quickly understand the components of Microsoft SharePoint.}
\par \trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s22\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Component}\cell\pard\plain \s22\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Description}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Site Collection}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A SharePoint Site Collection is a top level site that contains other sub-sites. The difference between a Site Collection and a Site is that a Site Collection contains separate security and is isolated from other Site Collections. A Site on the other hand is contained by a top level Site Collection and shares security and other aspects with other Sites within the same Site Collection.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Sites}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A SharePoint Site is nothing more than a website. At its root SharePoint is a website management system that provides a rich assortment of functionality that can be easily integrated into the SharePoint websites.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Document Libraries}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A Document Library is a mechanism to store content within SharePoint. A Document Library provides functionality for content management such as check-in and check-out, versioning, security, and workflow.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Lists}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A SharePoint List is simply a list of data. Much like you would have a grocery list a SharePoint List stores data in columns and rows.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Wikis}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A Wiki is a specialized website that allows community members the ability to update the content of the web site on the fly. A Wiki is not specific to SharePoint however SharePoint provides Wiki functionality as a feature.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Blogs}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A Blog is a web log or online journal. A blog provides a forum for people to write communications that can be viewed across the entire organization or Internet. Once a blog entry is posted the content can be commented and discussed on the blog entry page. Blogs are prevalent throughout modern society and SharePoint provides the ability to get a blog up and running in a manner of minutes.}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clvertalc\cellx1385\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
Discussion Boards}\cell\pard\plain \s21\intbl{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5
A Discussion Board allows for online discussion throughout the organization. A discussion board provides a forum for people to post questions and replies that can be viewed throughout the organization.}\cell\row\pard\sect\sectd\sectunlocked1\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1134\margrsxn1134\margtsxn1134\margbsxn1134\pgndec\sbknone\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af9\langfe2052\dbch\af7\afs24\alang1081\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\rtlch \ltrch\loch\loch\f5

